cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "expanded: static deobfuscation of protected x64 Windows binaries"
abstract: >-
  A family of static, fail-closed deobfuscators for protected binaries. vmpx-expanded
  strips VMProtect, recovers the entry point and encrypted import table, relocates
  mutated native code, and devirtualizes the guards in one command, without ever
  executing the protected sample. tigress-expanded (planned) targets the Tigress
  C obfuscator.
type: software
